Basic Info about the structs being used :

1) Cell : Stores the value of the cell (a double) and its integer
          coordinates (row and column) in the spreadsheet.
          (Should be enough as per the requirements of the assignment)

2) Cell1D : It is a dynamically sized array of pointers to Cell objects.
            This will be used to store the cells that are dependent on the
            current cell, which will be necessary for updating the values
            and checking for cyclic dependencies.

